de_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWB","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":190873362,"digest":"sha256:057149073f28049adb12d6b377de06165ca89597cf34fee103f3ed4e8b2e53d6","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:08Z"},{"id":697144709,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWF","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-amd64.zip.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":289,"digest":"sha256:61dfc574516c1de64fde4422b151af6acb725fba5c1c2ead85620fe24282995f","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:02Z"},{"id":697144724,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWU","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-arm64-installer.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":134036488,"digest":"sha256:15266515287c80ab2f123d7a0bdc0b1822c597e8e757a8d60fe2221a264d22be","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:06Z"},{"id":697144727,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWX","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-arm64-installer.exe.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":299,"digest":"sha256:73367a95c80fdf9468a2adec8e9568d89fa7120899f39e94e2a0bd905630c5ed","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:02Z"},{"id":697144743,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWn","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":186800608,"digest":"sha256:b99b9b775a206a9c052df34b13b9bdc75d06f2d83dc6babb35601611320e40b5","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:09Z"},{"id":697144751,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZWv","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-arm64.zip.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":289,"digest":"sha256:37f743d85e101038238d9a2ad217f2c230dd698fffe52eeaabc6a55107ba6b0a","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:03Z"},{"id":697144770,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84pjZXC","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":564,"digest":"sha256:5c765f9e41e35c1b4dfb6ddd64952789cbae07d102fbc549561d6eb7b026baeb","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T02:52:03Z"}],"body":"本版是修复版：收紧只读命令判定中 `python -v` 的漏洞，限制模型同时打开的网页数量，并修复手机窄屏布局、定时运行按钮空白、待发送区误显示按钮、中文路径导致会话读不出等问题。\n\n## 变更\n\n- 工作区在网络盘（如 SMB 映射盘）上时，运行无法判断写入范围的命令前的目录遍历改为并发读取，大目录树上等待大幅缩短。关联 #14813。\n- 启动环境摘要优先复用当前数据目录的可信快照，避免其他目录的探测结果改变系统提示、降低首次请求的缓存命中率。修复 #14676 by @SivanCola。\n\n## 修复\n\n- 安全：只读命令判定现在只把 `node` 和 `python` 单独的版本探针（如 `python3 -V`）当作只读；`python3 -v 脚本` 这类会运行代码的调用需要批准。关联 #14886。\n- 模型同时打开的网页上限为 12 个，超过时会提示它先关闭用完的页面，避免一次搜索开出几十个页面占用数 GB 内存；你自己打开的页面不受限。修复 #14844 fixed in #14866。\n- 手机窄屏：侧栏菜单按钮不再紧贴标志；设置页「关闭」与放大按钮并排，设置标签按内容宽度排列。修复 #14865 fixed in #14873、#14867 fixed in #14873、#14868 fixed in #14873。\n- 「自动化 → 定时运行」的「预览」和「确认创建」按钮不再显示为空白。修复 #14870 fixed in #14871。\n- 待发送区里已被当前轮接收的插话只显示「立即发送」与「取回」，不再出现点了就报\"当前状态不允许此操作\"的「改」和移动按钮。修复 #14875 fixed in #14877。\n- 会话的分支信息含中文路径时，不再因编码误判丢掉反斜杠、导致整个会话读不出来。关联 #14841 by @ShryukGrandhi。\n- 内置浏览器拾取元素时，属性名按属性值同样的上限裁剪。关联 #14580、#14849 by @jf200s。\n- `/migrate` 读不到旧会话目录时会报出目录和原因，不再说没有需要迁移的会话。关联 #14823 by @chuiwenwei。\n- `doctor repair` 读不到配置时报告 unreadable 并以非零退出，`--apply` 不再改写它；`doctor runtime` 没有可询问的 runtime 时显示 unknown。关联 #14824 by @chuiwenwei、#14825 by @chuiwenwei。\n- 完成报告、步骤提示和能力诊断里截断的中文等多字节文字不再出现半个字符。关联 #14842 by @kevin9327、#14843 by @kevin9327、#14851 by @kevin9327。\n\n## 贡献者\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：@SivanCola、@ShryukGrandhi、@jf200s、@chuiwenwei、@kevin9327\n\n---\n\n<!-- lang:en -->\n\n## Changed\n\n- With the workspace on a network drive such as an SMB share, the walk before an unclassified command reads concurrently, much faster on big trees. Refs #14813.\n- Startup summaries prefer the current data home's trusted snapshot, so another directory's probe no longer changes the system prompt and cold-starts the cache. Fixes #14676 by @SivanCola.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Security: the read-only check treats only a bare `node` or `python` version probe (such as `python3 -V`) as a read; `python3 -v script` and other calls that run code need approval. Refs #14886.\n- The model can have at most 12 pages open; past that it is asked to close finished ones, so one search no longer opens dozens. Your own pages are not limited. Fixes #14844 fixed in #14866.\n- On a phone, the sidebar menu button no longer touches the logo, Settings puts Close beside expand, and its tabs fit their content. Fixes #14865 fixed in #14873, #14867 fixed in #14873, #14868 fixed in #14873.\n- The \"Preview\" and \"Confirm\" buttons of Automation → Scheduled runs no longer show blank. Fixes #14870 fixed in #14871.\n- Guidance the running turn already accepted shows only send-now and withdraw in the pending panel, not the edit and move buttons that always failed. Fixes #14875 fixed in #14877.\n- A branch record holding a CJK path no longer loses a backslash to a wrong charset guess, which made the whole session unreadable. Refs #14841 by @ShryukGrandhi.\n- When the built-in browser picks an element, attribute names are clipped to the same limit as values. Refs #14580, #14849 by @jf200s.\n- `/migrate` names the directory and the cause when it cannot read the legacy sessions, instead of saying there was nothing to migrate. Refs #14823 by @chuiwenwei.\n- `doctor repair` reports an unreadable config and exits non-zero, `--apply` leaves it alone; `doctor runtime` says unknown with no runtime to ask. Refs #14824 by @chuiwenwei, #14825 by @chuiwenwei.\n- Multi-byte text cut in completion reports, step hints and capability diagnostics no longer ends in half a character. Refs #14842 by @kevin9327, #14843 by @kevin9327, #14851 by @kevin9327.\n\n## Contributors\n\nThanks to this release's contributors: @SivanCola, @ShryukGrandhi, @jf200s, @chuiwenwei, @kevin9327\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(ci): set up pnpm before the Node cache that needs it in the Android workflow by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14811\n* fix(ci): run the Android scripts through bash and build the kernel at the tag's version by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14812\n* fix(ci): the Android page check writes its token file owner-only by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14814\n* perf(agent): read the criteria walk's directories and files concurrently by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14813\n* ci(android): let the workflow build a branch as a trial run that publishes nothing by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14817\n* fix(android): verify the two POMs the Gradle classpath needs on CI, and store the file with LF by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14819\n* fix(android): verify the Linux aapt2 jar the CI build resolves by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14820\n* fix(boot): preserve environment snapshot precedence / 保持环境探测快照前缀稳定 by @SivanCola in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14676\n* fix(android): verify the 24 artifacts the release lint task resolves on CI by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14821\n* fix(doctor): a runtime nobody can ask is not clean by @chuiwenwei in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14825\n* fix(sessionstore): decode the branch-meta sidecar as UTF-8 before transcoding by @ShryukGrandhi in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14841\n* fix(evidence): cut a cited command in a rejection message on a rune boundary by @kevin9327 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14842\n* fix(complete_step): cut listed commands in the citation hint on a rune boundary by @kevin9327 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14843\n* fix(doctor): an unreadable config is not a missing one by @chuiwenwei in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14824\n* feat(studio): pick an element in the built-in browser by @jf200s in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14795\n* fix(studio): clip attribute keys like their values by @jf200s in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14849\n* ci(windows): give the full push suite room for a slow boot package by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14848\n* fix(migrate): an unreadable source is not an empty one by @chuiwenwei in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14823\n* test(migration): skip the unreadable-source cases where the platform cannot build one by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14850\n* fix(capdiag): cap sanitized diagnostic text on a rune boundary by @kevin9327 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14851\n* fix(browser): bound the pages the agent can have open at once by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14866\n* fix(studio): a primary button in settings keeps its fill with its foreground by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14871\n* fix(studio): phone-width spacing for the sidebar logo and the Settings header by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14873\n* fix(queue): draw edit and move only on lines the kernel can still change by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14877\n* fix(shellsafe): read-only only for a bare node or python version probe by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14886\n* docs(release): studio 2.56.1 notes by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14887\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/studio-v2.56.0...studio-v2.56.1\n\n\n---\n\n**macOS** 已用 Developer ID 签名并公证，打开时不需要清除隔离属性。**Windows** 的窗口、内核与安装器都经 Certum 代码签名证书做了 Authenticode 签名。**Linux** Debian 系从 `.deb` 安装，Fedora、RHEL、openSUSE 等从 `.rpm` 安装（`sudo dnf install ./ReasonixStudio-linux-amd64.rpm`）。x86_64 用文件名带 amd64 的包，aarch64（统信 UOS、麒麟等）用带 arm64 的包。也提供 `.AppImage`（只提供下载，不会自更新；需要 FUSE 2，或用 `--appimage-extract-and-run` 启动）。\n\n三个平台都能自更新：Linux 的 `.deb` 走自己的包（`.rpm` 的自更新尚未提供，请手动下载新包），Windows 运行下一个安装器，macOS 替换自身 bundle。\n","reactions":{"total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":6}
